    <selectionEntry id="23ca-7d98-98bc-cb70" name="Psychic Discipline: The Storm&apos;s Fury" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="581d-d4c4-ef70-deb7" name="The Call of the Wind" hidden="false" typeId="5405-b3c6-e8d0-4e77" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c0f-7e2f-586c-9305">Instead of moving in the Movement Phase, a Psyker with this Psychic Power may grant the Fleet (2) special rule to all friendly units within 6&quot; of the Psyker, this special rule lasts until the beginning of the Controlling player&apos;s next turn. When using this power, the controlling player may choose to have the Psyker make a Psychic check.  If the check is passed then the effect is improved to grant the Fleet (4) special rule, if the Check is failed then only the weaker form of the power is applied and the Psyker suffers Perils of the Warp.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="3087-6bed-5ace-7806" name="The Unseen Bolt" hidden="false" typeId="cede-0217-1b10-2a34" typeName="Psychic Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="62ec-fbf5-5252-0d17">72&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="17ff-12e7-77d3-2fbe">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="f431-a7b9-d9d0-36c9">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="2159-62b6-4337-d516">Heavy 1, Large Blast (5&quot;), Barrage, Shock Pulse, Force</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
