      <rules>
        <rule id="d123-4437-4646-81d8" name="Paired Weapons" hidden="false">
          <description>As Equinox power blade case is a pair of Melee weapons, each with different profiles, in any given Assault phase, the wielder must choose on of the following two profiles before making any attacks, and all their attacks in that Phase will use the chosen profile and gain the additional attack for using two combat weapons.</description>
