        <rule id="cbad-9d64-e773-00b3" name="Burning Lore" hidden="false">
          <description>Any Legion Praetor, Legion Cataphractii Praetor or Legion Tartaros Praetor with the Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers) special rule may select the Burning Lore upgrade for +25 points. A model with the Burning Lore upgrade gains the Corrupted and Psyker Unit Sub-types as well as the Diabolism Discipline (see the Diabolist entry).</description>
