      <rules>
        <rule name="Armour Interlock" id="3d20-3220-fe4c-1992" hidden="false">
          <description>If a model with this Special Rule is in base contact with another model with this Special Rule, then any friendly models within 3&quot; that claim an Intervening Model Cover Save from this model increase that save by one (i.e., from 6+ to 5+). This does not affect any Cover Save granted from any other source. This rule cannot increase a Cover Save to better than a 2+.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
