      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="eab3-133c-c8a9-1884" name="Saturnine Terminator Armour" hidden="false" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Legion Saturnine Terminator Armour confers a 2+ Armour Save and a 4+ Invulnerable save, as well as the Hammer of Wrath (1) Special Rule.

A unit that includes any models with Saturnine Terminator armour may not make Sweeping Advances.

In addition, a model armed with Saturnine Terminator Armour is immune to the effects of both the Rad-Phage Special Rule and of the effects of Rad Grenades and Rad Furnace wargear.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Hammer of Wrath (X)" id="a166-edab-c70d-52f3" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="aec0-c3aa-1e4e-1779">
          <modifiers>
