          <profiles>
            <profile id="dd4f-636f-83ea-835d" name="Fist of the Legion" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, a Legion Land Raider Dionysus automatically has Fist of the Legion as its Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait. If any friendly units within 24” can draw line of sight to a Legion Land Raider Dionysus, they may choose to count as Leadership 9 for Morale and Pinning tests they are required to make. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make an additional Reaction during their opponent’s Movement phase as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty. If taken in a Detachment using the Rite of War: Armoured Spearhead, a Legion Land Raider Dionysus replaces the Master of Armour ability, and must be taken as the Warlord.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </entryLink>
        <entryLink id="db7d-1aee-4d76-575f" name="Hexagrammaton Choice:" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" targetId="61a2-7005-1e6c-c08e" type="selectionEntryGroup"/>
