    <selectionEntry id="900a-a825-3260-cea3" name="Deredeo Atomantic Pavaise" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="2f84-f0be-8d2d-5af0" name="Deredeo Atomantic Pavaise" hidden="false" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A model armed with an Atomatic Pavaise gains an Invulnerable Save of 4+ against Shooting Attacks (but note this does not replace the effects of an Atomatic Deflector).

In addition, an Atomatic Pavaise grants friendly infantry models wholly within 4” of the Legion Deredeo Dreadnought’s base an Invulnerable Save of 6+ against Shooting Attacks or boosts an Invulnerable Save they already possess by +1, to a maximum of 4+.

Note that the bonus granted by an Atomantic Pavaise has no effect on Invulnerable saves in close combat, and its benefits do not stack with the effects of other Special Rules, Psychic Powers or items of Wargear (including other Atomantic Pavaises) which boost an existing Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
