                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="0982-427b-1d4a-d07c">All models with the Traitor Allegiance within 6&quot; of a model with a Staff of Dark Authority, including that model,  increases their Leadership to 10 when taking a Morale check or Pinning test.</characteristic>
